## Documentation

For full Karpenter documentation please checkout [https://karpenter.sh](https://karpenter.sh/docs/).

Chart-managed NodeClasses use `customResources.nodeClass.spec`; see `charts/examples/`. Images use top-level `image.repository`, `image.tag`, and optional `image.digest`.

Credential values use `credentials.ibmApiKey`, `credentials.vpcApiKey`, and `credentials.region`. The rendered `<fullname>-credentials` Secret uses underscore keys. Helm-managed changes restart the controller; direct Secret edits require a restart.

